    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "4 Bedroom home in an exclusive setting.\r\n\r\nNo. 10 The Granary is a bright & spacious end of terrace property, situated in an exclusive waterside development of just 10 homes. \r\nBoasting generous living accommodation which extends  to c. 123m², the property enjoys a beautiful waterfront location with panoramic views over the Ballinacurra Estuary and over to Ballyannon Woods, whilst being just a short walk from Midleton Town and all amenities. \r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended by appointment only by the selling agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION:\r\n\r\n Entrance Hallway:  3.85 x 2.55 timber floor with cloak room & store room off.  \r\n              \t\t\t\t \r\nGuest w.c. :  2.49 x 1.09 tiled floor, w.c. & w.h.b. \r\n\r\nLiving / Dining Area:  5.9 x 3.76  electric effect fire with marble surround, timber floor. \r\nFrench doors to South / Westerly patio & rear garden. \r\n\r\nKitchen:  3.48 x 2.49 tiled floor & splash back, built-in units & eye level presses, integrated electric hob & oven, plumbed for washing machine & dishwasher. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR :\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom:  4.73x3.15 built-in wardrobes. \r\nEn-Suite: 2.18 x 1.51 fully tiled, w.c., w.h.b & electric shower. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.67 x 2.74  \r\n\r\nBedroom 3:  3.12 x 2.55 \r\n\r\nBathroom:  2.07 x 1.67  tiled floor, bath area & half wall, bath, w.c. & w.h.b. \r\n\r\nBedroom 4: 3.75 x 2.13 \r\n\r\n OUTSIDE:   \r\n 2 allocated parking spaces to the front with ample visitor parking. \r\n Enclosed private rear garden with a sunny South Westerly aspect. \r\n\r\nFEATURES:\r\n\r\nDecorated & finished to a high standard throughout. \r\nGenerous living accommodation (123m²).\r\nGuest w.c. on ground floor.\r\nMaster Bedroom en-suite. \r\nStira access to attic.\r\n2 allocated parking spaces to the front & ample visitor parking. \r\nSouth Westerly facing rear garden with patio & stunning views of Estuary & Ballyannon Woods. \r\nPrivate, gated walkway to the Estuary. \r\nGas fired central heating. \r\nConvenient location  -  Situated adjacent to the Ballinacurra to Midleton Cycle Way and within walking distance of Midleton's Main Street and all amenities including a huge selection of schools, shops, bars, supermarkets, restaurants, Omniplex cinema, the popular Midleton Farmers Market which takes place every Saturday and the Midleton / Youghal Greenway, along with bus and rail services. \r\nExcellent connectively with easy access onto the N25 & nearby bus and rail services. \r\n                           \r\nSERVICE CHARGE:   €2,400 per annum. \r\n\r\nSERVICES:  Mains water, drainage & gas."
      },
